  "rootAssessment": "I assent to exact description187-r3 after reading the complete independent review and rehashing all22members and21candidate inputs. Both lists pass the actual unchanged verifier pin_rows sorted/unique check. The R2 binding failure was a publication ordering defect, not a code or passage change; the failed uncommitted materialization was preserved and all172protected files restored, with no R2 contract commit or binding inferred. R3 preserves rejected R1 and independently accepted-but-unbound R2 histories. All22passage arrays are exactly R2; installation.rs now accurately describes its debug/test or debug-plus-scenario-fixtures read hook and typed TreeFault::Io read mapping, while resolved member offset/path construction remains solely attributed to retained_tree.rs. Eight exact raw239overrides and fourteen exact accepted-predecessor supersessions preserve161inherited meanings and yield169effective meanings without collision, including three predecessor-supersession chains; the next inventory must fold all14. Ten new raw239rows and all prior186contracts/199inventory bindings/161inheritance entries stay unchanged. No runtime code, source profiles, authority, Source/spawn/effects/settlement or production C4/J2/lifetime wiring is introduced. D5 general graph, CI4/H/source39/Linux/platform/owner/privacy/clock/T2/CF and full-project qualification remain owed. Binding is contingent on complete unchanged verify_design success; status publication and push remain separate follow-ups.",
